<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Emergency Homelab Recovery Passport (Template)</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-base: #0a0d14;
            --bg-surface: #111622;
            --bg-card: #161d2d;
            --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --accent-primary: #38bdf8;
            --accent-green: #34d399;
            --accent-amber: #fbbf24;
            --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-base);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .passport-card {
            background: var(--bg-surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 16px;
            max-width: 850px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .header-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .badge-free {
            background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3);
            color: var(--accent-green);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .alert-box {
            background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
            color: #fde68a;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-primary);
            margin: 24px 0 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            text-align: left;
        }

        th { background: var(--bg-card); color: #fff; }
        td { color: var(--text-secondary); }

        .key-box {
            background: #000;
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            color: var(--accent-green);
            font-size: 14px;
            word-break: break-all;
            margin: 8px 0 16px;
            user-select: all;
        }

        pre {
            background: #000;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #050811;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }

        @media print {
            body { background: #fff; color: #000; padding: 0; }
            .passport-card { border: none; box-shadow: none; padding: 0; }
            .btn-group { display: none; }
            .key-box, pre { background: #f1f5f9; color: #000; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; }
            th { background: #e2e8f0; color: #000; }
            td { color: #000; }
            .section-title { color: #0284c7; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="passport-card">
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-title">🛡️ Emergency Recovery Passport (Template)</div>
        <div class="badge-free">✓ Encrypted Off-Site Backup</div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert-box">
        ⚠️ <strong>SAVE THIS DOCUMENT:</strong> Save a copy into your Password Manager or secure physical storage. Fill in your own backup server and master encryption key.
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">1. Master Recovery Credentials & Cloud Info</div>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width:35%;">Item</th>
            <th>Value</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Backup Target</strong></td>
            <td>Offsite SFTP / Restic REST Server</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Backup Server Host / IP</strong></td>
            <td><code>&lt;YOUR_BACKUP_SERVER_IP&gt;</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Backup User</strong></td>
            <td><code>backupuser</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>SSH Key Location</strong></td>
            <td><code>~/.ssh/id_ed25519</code></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Remote Storage Path</strong></td>
            <td><code>/var/backups/restic</code></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-primary);">MASTER ENCRYPTION PASSWORD:</div>
    <div class="key-box">&lt;GENERATE_WITH_OPENSSL_RAND_HEX_24&gt;</div>

    <div class="section-title">2. Disaster Recovery Instructions</div>
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 8px;">Run these commands on a fresh installation to restore all persistent volumes and data:</p>
    
    <pre><code># 1. Install Restic
sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y restic

# 2. Configure Password
sudo mkdir -p /etc/restic
echo "&lt;YOUR_ENCRYPTION_PASSWORD&gt;" | sudo tee /etc/restic/password
sudo chmod 600 /etc/restic/password

# 3. Restore all data from backup target
sudo restic -r sftp:backupuser@&lt;YOUR_BACKUP_SERVER_IP&gt;:/var/backups/restic --password-file /etc/restic/password restore latest --target /

# 4. Restart Docker services
sudo systemctl restart docker</code></pre>

    <div class="btn-group">
        <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn btn-primary">🖨️ Print / Save as PDF</button>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">🏠 Back to Portal</a>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
